Guests have highlighted it among the hotel''s bar venues for its beachfront views, making it a popular stop for a sundowner or evening drink while looking out over Camps Bay''s beach and the Atlantic beyond. Being one of several dining and drinking options at the same property gives hotel guests and visiting diners a choice of settings within a single venue, from casual bar seating to the more formal restaurants nearby. Located within The Bay Hotel on Victoria Road in Camps Bay, Traders suits visitors after drinks with a sea view rather than a full sit-down meal.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://thebayhotel.com/contact/', '$[#]', 'https://www.campsbayapartments.com/camps-bay-restaurants/', '$[#]', 'https://thebayhotel.com/restaurants/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'traders-camps-bay' AND description = 'Traders is one of four on-site dining and bar venues at The Bay Hotel in Camps Bay, alongside the hotel''s Tides breakfast restaurant, Bistro @ The Bay and Caamil''s Bar, and is highlighted by guests as one of the hotel''s bar venues with beachfront views.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
