A cardio and functional training zone covers more conventional gym workouts, while saunas and steam rooms give members a recovery option after training. Free underground parking is available for members, a practical feature for a gym located within a business park rather than a shopping centre with shared parking. Located in Westlake Business Park, Westlake, Cape Town, the club serves members across Westlake, Tokai and the surrounding Constantia Valley area with a wide spread of pool, class and gym facilities under one roof.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://za.africabz.com/western-cape/virgin-active-steenberg-26206', '$[#]', 'https://za.gymcity.info/virgin-active-steenberg-1544438', '$[#]', 'https://www.virginactive.co.za/gyms/steenberg'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'virgin-active-steenberg-westlake' AND description = 'Virgin Active Steenberg is a full-service health club in Westlake Business Park with two heated swimming pools, a Mind Body Studio for yoga and Pilates, a cycle studio, a dance/boxing/HIIT studio, a cardio and functional training zone, saunas and steam rooms, and free underground parking for members.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
