The cafe is licensed to serve alcohol, offers WiFi for customers working or browsing over a meal, and provides parking for visitors, a useful combination for a neighbourhood cafe that draws both quick lunch customers and people staying longer. It occupies a site previously home to Carlucci''s, a change that long-time Oranjezicht residents will recognise from the area''s cafe history. Located on Upper Orange Street in Oranjezicht, Cape Town, the cafe serves locals and visitors to the City Bowl''s upper slopes looking for a relaxed all-day meal.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.eatout.co.za/venue/carluccis-oranjezicht/', '$[#]', 'https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g312659-d10470572-Reviews-Will_s_Cafe_Deli-Cape_Town_Central_Western_Cape.html', '$[#]', 'https://www.facebook.com/WillsCafeDeli/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wills-cafe-deli-oranjezicht' AND description = 'Will''s Cafe & Deli is a delicatessen-style cafe in Oranjezicht serving freshly made sandwiches, salads and breakfasts throughout the day, with licensed service, WiFi and parking. It occupies the site previously home to Carlucci''s.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
